stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Open
  Open --> Asked: need is stated
  Open --> Offered: capability is offered
  Asked --> Connected: provider found
  Offered --> Connected: requester found
  Asked --> Open: no match yet
  Connected --> InProgress: both choose to proceed
  InProgress --> Completed: useful help delivered
  InProgress --> Closed: stop, unsafe, or unsuitable
  Completed --> Shared: optional result sharing
  Completed --> [*]
  Shared --> Replicated: optional adaptation
  Replicated --> Open: new local interaction
  Closed --> [*]
